# Title: Linux Network Service Scanning Tools Execution
# ID: 3e102cd9-a70d-4a7a-9508-403963092f31
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Alejandro Ortuno, oscd.community, Georg Lauenstein (sure[secure])
# Date: 2020-10-21
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1046
# Description: Detects execution of network scanning and reconnaisance tools. These tools can be used for the enumeration of local or remote network services for example.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process.executable:*/nc OR process.executable:*/ncat OR process.executable:*/netcat OR process.executable:*/socat)) AND NOT (((process.command_line:* --listen * OR process.command_line:* -l *)))) OR ((process.executable:*/autorecon OR process.executable:*/hping OR process.executable:*/hping2 OR process.executable:*/hping3 OR process.executable:*/naabu OR process.executable:*/nmap OR process.executable:*/nping OR process.executable:*/telnet OR process.executable:*/zenmap)))
